Asia‑Pacific exhibits the fastest growth, propelled by rapid expansion of private hospital chains and government‑backed screening campaigns. Cost‑sensitive operators gravitate toward domestically produced scopes, prompting multinational manufacturers to establish joint ventures for local assembly and tailored pricing.
