The Gulf Cooperation Council invests heavily in specialty hospitals, adopting state‑of‑the‑art endoscopy suites as symbols of premium care. In many African capitals, targeted aid initiatives and mobile endoscopy units introduce basic white‑light technology, laying the groundwork for future upgrades as health budgets expand.
